TA FECHA","enable_line":true,"text_size":4}},"heading_rxQfPL":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"REBORN 21 AL 25 ABRIL","text_size":8}},"text_YbgMzV":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Este viernes 25 de abril, tendremos venta Bloomreuse y 5 invitados muy especiales para vender ropa de segunda mano.<\/p><p>Estarán los closet de los invitados:<\/p><p>*Laura Hamilton<\/p><p>*Cata Izcue<\/p><p>*Fer Valenzuela<\/p><p>*Aline Israel<\/p><p>*Manu Prado<\/p><p>Todo en nuestra tienda Froens Luis Pasteur.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","text_size":4,"text_columns":1}},"button_Tigy4j":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"link_text_1":"Shop all","link_1":"shopify:\/\/collections\/all","button_size_1":"btn--medium","button_style_1":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_1":"btn--neutral","link_text_2":"","link_2":"","button_size_2":"btn--medium","button_style_2":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_2":"btn--neutral","link_text_3":"","link_3":"","button_size_3":"btn--long","button_style_3":"btn-text-thick-line","button_color_3":"btn--white"}}},"block_order":["kicker_4eePGN","heading_rxQfPL","text_YbgMzV","button_Tigy4j"],"settings":{"align_text":"text-left","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","content_width":2000,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":0}},"a6478552-1e37-4a68-9378-db958e056208":{"type":"section-double","blocks":{"template--16770759065812__a6478552-1e37-4a68-9378-db958e056208-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"kicker":"FROENS SECONDHAND","title":"RECIRCULAR","text":"<p>Los datos no mienten: el desecho de ropa se ha convertido en una emergencia medioambiental en todo el mundo, con el equivalente a un camión lleno de ropa incinerado o llevado a un vertedero cada segundo.<\/p><p>En Froens somos conscientes del problema y nuestra misión principal es hacer ROPA PARA DURAR. Pero necesitamos redoblar los esfuerzos para luchar en contra el desecho textil. Es por esto que a nuestro plan Reborn sumamos una nueva y gran iniciativa: <strong>FROENS SECONDHAND.<\/strong><\/p><p>En nuestra plataforma de reventa creada por Bloom Reuse, podrás darle una segunda vida a tus prendas froens vendiendo o comprando ropa en excelente estado y por el mejor precio!!!<\/p><p><strong>Súmate al consumo consciente en <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/froens.bloomreuse.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/froens.bloomreuse.com\/\"><strong>froens.bloomreuse.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p>","font_size":4,"text_columns":1,"align_text":"text-left","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn-text-thick-line","text_color":"text--neutral","bg_color":""}},"template--16770759065812__a6478552-1e37-4a68-9378-db958e056208-image-1":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/RECIRCULAR.webp","overlay_opacity":0,"overlay_color":"#000000","enable_overlay_text":false,"kicker":"","title":"","richtext":"","text_align":"align--middle-center","text_color":"text--white","link_text":"","link":"https:\/\/froens.bloomreuse.com\/","button_color":"btn--white","button_style":"btn"}}},"block_order":["template--16770759065812__a6478552-1e37-4a68-9378-db958e056208-text-1","template--16770759065812__a6478552-1e37-4a68-9378-db958e056208-image-1"],"settings":{"height":"use_screen_one_half","brick_gutter":40,"borders":false,"bg_color":"","preload_image":false,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"9fc19e1f-29d0-46a9-bd02-6f4889e5cac8":{"type":"section-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/RECIRCULAR_21af6174-b7ca-4ac3-9149-d874a6780e58.webp","max_width":100,"x_align":"center","color_bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"dce5d25b-816b-460a-bc4b-764d69e0db7c":{"type":"section-double","blocks":{"836e7680-210e-4a9b-87a3-136e0330e6f4":{"type":"text","settings":{"kicker":"COLECCIÓN UPCYCLING","title":"REUTILIZAR","text":"<p>Reunimos nuestras productos con fallas para transformarlas y darles una segunda vida.<\/p><p>De esta forma, creamos nuestra colección Reborn: accesorios y prendas únicas e irrepetibles, creadas utilizando diferentes técnicas como el upcycling y el tie-dye, lo que nos ha permitido <strong>REUTILIZAR MÁS DE 800 PRENDAS!!!<\/strong><\/p><p>Estas colecciones de edición limitada son creadas por <strong>Minka<\/strong>, marca de accesorios hechos a mano con descartes de la industria textil. Minka da empleo en un sistema de trabajo flexible a mujeres de comunidades vulnerables y busca, a través del diseño, impactar de manera positiva a nuestra comunidad.<\/p>","font_size":4,"text_columns":1,"align_text":"text-left","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn-text-thick-line","text_color":"text--neutral","bg_color":""}},"ae4187d6-a35e-4ba9-9e50-bee43474c56e":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ROPA-REBORN-GIF.gif","overlay_opacity":0,"overlay_color":"#000000","enable_overlay_text":false,"kicker":"","title":"","richtext":"","text_align":"align--middle-center","text_color":"text--white","link_text":"","link":"","button_color":"btn--white","button_style":"btn"}}},"block_order":["836e7680-210e-4a9b-87a3-136e0330e6f4","ae4187d6-a35e-4ba9-9e50-bee43474c56e"],"settings":{"height":"use_screen_one_half","brick_gutter":40,"borders":false,"bg_color":"","preload_image":false,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"ebf99b5f-0785-464f-937a-c3969c638e1e":{"type":"section-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/REUTILIZAR_f5947a82-9cdc-45da-a0e9-aad5e99edac4.webp","max_width":100,"x_align":"center","color_bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"629144d1-4e30-4e20-90c1-614b15e029ee":{"type":"section-columns","blocks":{"template--16770759065812__629144d1-4e30-4e20-90c1-614b15e029ee-text_block-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/colets_reborn.webp","title":"COLETS","text":"<p>Fabricados a partir de camisas y vestidos de lino y viscosa.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn--soft","enable_video":false,"video_link":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc"}},"template--16770759065812__629144d1-4e30-4e20-90c1-614b15e029ee-text_block-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/shorts_reborn.webp","title":"SHORTS Y JEANS","text":"<p>Reutilizamos nuestros propios jeans con fallas y les damos una segunda vida<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn--soft","enable_video":false,"video_link":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc"}},"template--16770759065812__629144d1-4e30-4e20-90c1-614b15e029ee-text_block-3":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/poleras_reborn.webp","title":"POLERAS Y POLERONES","text":"<p>Renovadas y teñidas con técnica tie dye<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn--soft","enable_video":false,"video_link":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc"}}},"block_order":["template--16770759065812__629144d1-4e30-4e20-90c1-614b15e029ee-text_block-1","template--16770759065812__629144d1-4e30-4e20-90c1-614b15e029ee-text_block-2","template--16770759065812__629144d1-4e30-4e20-90c1-614b15e029ee-text_block-3"],"settings":{"title":"COLECCIÓN UPCYCLING","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","align_text":"text-center","scale_image":true,"wh_ratio":1,"grid_large":3,"grid_medium":3,"grid_mobile":1.9,"progress_bar_mobile":false,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"section_double_ATeRRE":{"type":"section-double","blocks":{"text_CFm4iV":{"type":"text","settings":{"kicker":"JORNADAS DE REPARACIÓN DE ROPA","title":"REPARAR","text":"<p>Estamos convencidos de que la ropa <strong>NO DEBERÍA SER DESECHABLE<\/strong> y trabajamos día a día para crear las prendas más conscientes y duraderas posibles.<\/p><p>Parte importante de alargar el ciclo de vida de tu ropa es poder repararla. <strong>Por eso junto a REPARALAB te ofrecemos jornadas de reparación gratuitas<\/strong> en nuestra Casa Froens, donde puedes traer tu ropa de cualquier marca, arreglarla y seguir usándola por mucho tiempo más!!!<\/p><p><strong>REPARALAB<\/strong> es un proyecto itinerante de reparación creado por los pioneros en economía circular Modulab. Su premisa es \"No lo botes, ¡repáralo!\"<\/p><p>En 4 jornadas hemos reparado la ropa de más de 120 personas para darles una segunda vida y extender su vida útil.<\/p>","font_size":4,"text_columns":1,"align_text":"text-left","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn-text-thick-line","text_color":"text--neutral","bg_color":""}},"image_REimwJ":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/REPARALAB-GIF.gif","overlay_opacity":0,"overlay_color":"#000000","enable_overlay_text":false,"kicker":"","title":"","richtext":"","text_align":"align--middle-center","text_color":"text--white","link_text":"","link":"","button_color":"btn--white","button_style":"btn"}}},"block_order":["text_CFm4iV","image_REimwJ"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"height":"use_screen_one_half","brick_gutter":40,"borders":false,"bg_color":"","preload_image":false,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"section_image_TaTnKU":{"type":"section-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/REPARAR.webp","max_width":100,"x_align":"center","color_bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"0be96bd6-f020-4be9-85b5-2fb3b1d0f77a":{"type":"section-double","blocks":{"5bf1f246-6e19-4c4d-aa04-99de8d265c83":{"type":"text","settings":{"kicker":"GESTIONAR EL FIN DE CICLO DE VIDA","title":"RECICLAR","text":"<p>Cuando ya no es posible reutilizar o reparar la ropa, es necesario reciclarla de manera responsable para evitar que llegue a los vertederos o peor, a nuestro propio Desierto de Atacama, que hoy sufre las consecuencias de la mala gestión de ropa que no pudo ser comercializada o simplemente fue desechada.<\/p><p><strong>Ven a reciclar tu ropa desde el 21 al 25 de abril en nuestras tiendas de Luis Pasteur, Mall Vivo los Trapenses, Costanera Center y Paseo los Dominicos. ¡Ya hemos reciclado más de 500 kilos de ropa!<\/strong><\/p><p>El proceso de reciclaje estará a cargo de <strong>CIRKLA<\/strong>, empresa experta en reciclaje textil industrial que cuenta con el patrocinio del Ministerio del Medio Ambiente.<\/p>","font_size":4,"text_columns":1,"align_text":"text-left","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn-text-thick-line","text_color":"text--neutral","bg_color":""}},"397eada2-7026-4bb0-91d7-4fe2a1d682be":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/RECICLAJE-GIF.gif","overlay_opacity":0,"overlay_color":"#000000","enable_overlay_text":false,"kicker":"","title":"","richtext":"","text_align":"align--middle-center","text_color":"text--white","link_text":"","link":"","button_color":"btn--white","button_style":"btn"}}},"block_order":["5bf1f246-6e19-4c4d-aa04-99de8d265c83","397eada2-7026-4bb0-91d7-4fe2a1d682be"],"settings":{"height":"use_screen_one_half","brick_gutter":40,"borders":false,"bg_color":"","preload_image":false,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"section_image_EYxngC":{"type":"section-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/RECICLAR.webp","max_width":100,"x_align":"center","color_bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"02c69a08-da5a-4b74-b3be-c586934e24b3":{"type":"section-icons","blocks":{"template--16770759065812__02c69a08-da5a-4b74-b3be-c586934e24b3-icon_block-1":{"type":"icon_block","settings":{"icon_name":"icon-recycled","icon_color":"#aaaaaa","title":"Ignacia Nuñez, Minka","text":"<p>Nos encantó la colaboración con Froens, porque se hicieron cargo de gestionar sus mermas. Son pioneros en incluir un modelo de economía circular.<\/p>","link_text":"","link_url":""}},"template--16770759065812__02c69a08-da5a-4b74-b3be-c586934e24b3-icon_block-2":{"type":"icon_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"icon_name":"icon-sewing-machine","icon_color":"#aaaaaa","title":"Pamela Castro, Reparalab","text":"<p>Elegimos trabajar con Froens porque buscamos marcas que de verdad estén comprometidas con la reparación y la circularidad y no caigan en greenwashing.<\/p>","link_text":"","link_url":""}}},"block_order":["template--16770759065812__02c69a08-da5a-4b74-b3be-c586934e24b3-icon_block-1","template--16770759065812__02c69a08-da5a-4b74-b3be-c586934e24b3-icon_block-2"],"settings":{"title":"","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","icon_alignment":"icon--top","layout":"grid--stacked","align_text":"text-center","width":"wrapper","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":40}}},"order":["main","9a72e90f-b8c5-4730-83d1-ff70adb6273f","section_richtext_KEGrPJ","048b569f-d091-47ef-aeb8-07115f7736d6","section_richtext_bDBbLX","a6478552-1e37-4a68-9378-db958e056208","9fc19e1f-29d0-46a9-bd02-6f4889e5cac8","dce5d25b-816b-460a-bc4b-764d69e0db7c","ebf99b5f-0785-464f-937a-c3969c638e1e","629144d1-4e30-4e20-90c1-614b15e029ee","section_double_ATeRRE","section_image_TaTnKU","0be96bd6-f020-4be9-85b5-2fb3b1d0f77a","section_image_EYxngC","02c69a08-da5a-4b74-b3be-c586934e24b3"]}